<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 3.7 percent in the week ended January 17, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages fell 5.5 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages rose 7.2 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index fell 5.5 percent to 305.8 from 323.6 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index rose 1.0 percent to 180.0 in the latest survey from 178.3 in the previous week.  </p>
